## Summary

The SLE2 component focuses on practical performance analysis of search algorithms. 
The work includes implementing the algorithm, measuring execution time for different 
input sizes, and using `py-spy` to observe where the Python program spends its CPU time.

The results are used to compare theoretical complexity with practical performance 
on real hardware.